  "question": {
    "text": "A polished metal plate with a rough black spot on it is heated to about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1400</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> and quickly taken to a dark room. The spot will appear\r",
